      <chord name="Bm"/>For <chord name="C"/>allthe <chord name="D"/>saints <chord name="Em"/>who <chord name="Bm"/>from <chord name="Em/B"/>their <chord name="Am"/>labors <chord name="G"/>rest,<br/>
